<title>NEW ZEALAND: Arthur Barnett yr profit down 25.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Arthur Barnett yr profit down 25.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to August 1.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.41 vs 1.90</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   25.7 vs 34.6</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    6.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Total div for year		   9.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				44.3 vs 48.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  1.4 vs 1.9</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)     5.5 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries no imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 8</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 8</p>
<p>    Ex div   Nov 14</p>
<p>Note - Arthur Barnett is a retailer.</p>
</text>
